Bundled third-party runtime:

  KaTeX 0.19.1 — https://katex.org
  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2013-2020 Khan Academy and other contributors

  - client.katex.js — the KaTeX browser build, vendored unmodified by
    scripts/build-katex-chunk.mjs and wrapped in the DSH package-local chunk
    registration. The plugin ships no KaTeX stylesheet or fonts: the DSH Web
    page already loads them for conversation math, and MathML output is used
    when that stylesheet is absent.
  - The generated chunk, its pinned version and the SHA-256 of the upstream
    katex.min.js are recorded in the file header; regenerate it with
    `npm run build:katex` after deliberately upgrading the dev dependency.

